msgctxt "trade-comms"
msgid "Why are you bothering me?"
msgstr "Pourquoi me dérangez-vous ?"

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:5996
msgctxt "ship-comms"
msgid ""
"Sorry, we have no time to chat with you.\n"
"We are on an important mission."
msgstr ""
"Désolé, nous n'avons pas le temps de discuter avec vous.\n"
"Nous sommes en mission de la plus haute importance."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:5998
msgctxt "ship-comms"
msgid ""
"We have nothing for you.\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons rien pour vous.\n"
"Bonne journée."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6513
#, lua-format
msgctxt "goal-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the delta quadrant, %s. The independent stations in the area "
"outnumber the human naval stations, but they all rely on us to protect them."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenue dans le quadrant Delta, équipage du %s,\n"
"Dans cette région, les stations indépendantes sont plus nombreuses que les "
"stations de la Marine humaine, mais elles comptent toutes sur nous pour les "
"protéger."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6514
msgctxt "goal-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Your job is to patrol between the three major human naval stations: Asimov, "
"Utopia Planitia and Armstrong. You'll need to dock with each of these "
"stations. Automated systems will extract your routes and track your progress "
"on patrolling between these stations. The primary objective of your patrol "
"is to watch for enemy ships and intercept them, prevent them from destroying "
"the three bases mentioned as your patrol endpoints. Enemies in the area may "
"harass other stations in the area. Protecting the other stations is your "
"secondary objective. Spread goodwill in this high growth, high value "
"quadrant. Our enemies dearly wish to give us a black eye here and claim it "
"for their own."
msgstr ""
"Votre mission consiste à patrouiller entre les trois principales stations "
"navales humaines : Asimov, Utopia Planitia et Armstrong. Vous devrez à "
"chaque fois vous amarrer à ces stations. Des systèmes automatisés extrairont "
"vos itinéraires et suivront vos progrès.\n"
"\n"
"L'objectif principal de votre patrouille est de surveiller les vaisseaux "
"ennemis et de les intercepter avant qu'ils n'attaquent et ne détruisent nos "
"3 stations. Les ennemis pouvant attaquer les autres stations du secteur, "
"votre objectif secondaire est de les protéger également.\n"
"\n"
"Répandez la bienveillance et la confiance dans ce quadrant en pleine "
"croissance et à forte valeur. Nos ennemis revendiquent ardemment ce quadrant "
"et nous mènent la vie dure."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6523
#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6691
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Asimov station destroyed"
msgstr "Station Asimov détruite."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6528
#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6696
#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6789
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Utopia Planitia station destroyed"
msgstr "Station Utopia Planitia détruite."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6533
#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6701
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Armstrong station destroyed"
msgstr "Station Armstrong détruite."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6736
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Rid the area of remaining enemies. Combined sensors show %i ships"
msgstr ""
"Débarrasser la zone des ennemis restants. Les capteurs combinés indiquent %i "
"vaisseaux."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6741
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-shipLog"
msgid ""
"You completed your patrol docking duties, but enemy ships still pollute the "
"area. Be sure to clean those up. Combined sensor readings from area stations "
"put the current count at %i enemy ships. Feel free to continue to dock to "
"repair and replenish if desired. Oh yes, I almost forgot, you're still "
"responsible for protecting stations Asimov, Armstrong and Utopia Planitia"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez terminé votre mission de patrouille, mais les vaisseaux ennemis "
"infestent toujours la zone. Assurez-vous de la nettoyer de tout danger.\n"
"Les lectures combinées des capteurs des stations de la zone indiquent qu'il "
"reste encore %i vaisseaux ennemis.\n"
"N'hésitez pas à vous amarrer aux stations pour réparer et vous "
"réapprovisionner si nécessaire.\n"
" Bonne chance !\n"
"…Ah oui, j'ai failli oublier, vous êtes toujours en charge de la protection "
"des stations Asimov, Armstrong et Utopia Planitia."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:6751
msgctxt "UPlanitia1Orders-shipLog"
