msgid "|> UTPLNT116"
msgstr "|> Station UPlanitia"

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:8043
msgctxt "UPlanitia6-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Utopia Planitia] Bring artifacts to Utopia Planitia and we can improve ship "
"maneuverability"
msgstr ""
"[Utopia Planitia] Rapportez-nous des artefacts et nous pourrons améliorer la "
"manœuvre de votre vaisseau."

#: scripts/scenario_54_PatrolDuty.lua:8068
msgctxt "UPlanitia7-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Utopia Planitia] We received the artifacts. We can improve ship "
"maneuverability next time you dock"
msgstr ""
"[Utopia Planitia] Nous avons bien reçu les artefacts. Dès que vous aurez "
"accostés, nous pourrons effectuer la mise à niveau de votre vaisseau."

